https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect

The Effect library. `repos/effect.toml` pins it to the tag
`effect@4.0.0-rc.115`, and `bun run vendor` fetches it into `repos/effect`,
which is git-ignored: an agent reads it, and this repository neither builds nor
ships it. Because none of it is committed, the copy below is the only one in
this tree rather than a repeat of a `LICENSE` beside it.

The `effect-patterns` Reference adapts examples out of that library and says so
at the foot of its own text, because a Body installed into `$HOME` leaves this
file behind.

